        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: OFAB-100-120, Sukhoi Su-30\n- Companies: Sukhoi Aviation Corporation\n- Places: Russia\n- Topics: Aircraft types, Compatible aircraft\n\nFacts:\n- The Sukhoi Su-30 is a twin-engine, two-seat, supermaneuverable fighter aircraft.\n- The Sukhoi Su-30 was developed by Russia's Sukhoi Aviation Corporation.\n- The Sukhoi Su-30 has the NATO reporting name Flanker-C.\n- The OFAB-100-120 is a small bomb.\n- The OFAB-100-120 can be carried on Sukhoi Su-17, Sukhoi Su-25, and Sukhoi Su-30 aircraft.",
